OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 100 cans of Fosters
OL,4,Adumped in ditch
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 Fosters lager cans have
OL,7,Fbeen found dumped in a ditch in
OL,8,FLincolnshire.
OL,10,FOn Friday, Rachael, from Upton,
OL,11,Fdiscovered 101 Fosters cans, 18 mixed
OL,12,Fbeer tins and three bottles of
OL,13,Fmouthwash in a ditch in Kexby while
OL,14,Flitter picking with her son.
OL,16,FRachael said the litter "lowers the
OL,17,Ftone of the area" and "looks
OL,18,Fdisgusting", adding that the ditch had
OL,19,Fbeen clear of rubbish two weeks
OL,20,Fearlier.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
