OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 100 cans of Fosters
OL,4,Adumped in ditch
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think the people who are responsible
OL,7,Fjust need to take ownership of the fact
OL,8,Fthat they've generated this," she said.
